msgid ""
"# 模型评测\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Model Evaluation\n"
""

msgid ""
"不同模型步骤一致，仅以Qwen3-30B为例列举\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The steps are the same for different models. This section lists only Qwen3-30B as an example.\n"
""

msgid ""
"我们通过 AISBench 评估模型，该工具支持vllm/sglang多种推理后端的评估\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Evaluate the model using AISBench, which supports the evaluation of multiple inference backends, including vllm and sglang.\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 1.安装方法\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 1. Installation Methods\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 2.下载评估数据集\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 2. Download the evaluation dataset\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 3.权重转换\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 3. Weight Conversion\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前verl已经支持mbridge直接保存hf格式模型权重，无需转换即可使用。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Currently, verl supports mbridge to directly save model weights in Hugging Face format, so you can use them without conversion.\n"
""

msgid ""
"如果模型权重不是hf格式，需要先转换为hf格式，再进行评估。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"If the model weights are not in the hf format, convert them to the hf format first, and then perform the evaluation.\n"
""

msgid ""
"此处参照verl原生[转换方法](../../../../../docs/advance/checkpoint.rst)\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For reference, see the native verl [conversion method](../../../../../docs/advance/checkpoint.rst).\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 4.vllm推理评测\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 4.vllm Inference Evaluation\n"
""

msgid ""
"**启动vllm_server服务**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Starting the vllm_server service**\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过以下命令拉起推理服务端，需要修改的参数：model和tensor-parallel-size。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Start the inference server using the following command. You need to modify the following parameters: model and tensor-parallel-size.\n"
""

msgid ""
"model：保存训练后权重转换完的huggingface模型地址；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"model: The path to the huggingface model saved after the post-training weights are converted;\n"
""

msgid ""
"tensor-parallel-size：张量并行副本数，TP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"tensor-parallel-size: The number of tensor parallelism replicas. Keep TP consistent with the infer configuration during training;\n"
""

msgid ""
"data-parallel-size：数据并行副本数，DP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致，默认为1；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"data-parallel-size: Number of data parallelism replicas. It is recommended that DP remains consistent with the infer configuration during training. The default value is 1;\n"
""

msgid ""
"port：可任意设置空闲端口；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"port: You can set this to any idle port;\n"
""

msgid ""
"**修改AISBench推理配置启动vllm_client评测**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Modify the AISBench inference configuration to start the vllm_client evaluation**\n"
""

msgid ""
"打开推理配置文件 benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py \n"
""
msgstr ""
"Open the inference configuration file benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py\n"
""

msgid ""
"host_port需与服务端的port一致，根据模型配置修改max_seq_len和max_out_len\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.models import VLLMCustomAPIChatStream\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.utils.model_postprocessors import extract_non_reasoning_content\n"
""
msgstr ""
"host_port must match the server port. Modify max_seq_len and max_out_len based on the model configuration.\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.models import VLLMCustomAPIChatStream\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.utils.model_postprocessors import extract_non_reasoning_content\n"
""

msgid ""
"另起一个窗口进行评测，开启评测命令：\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"    ais_bench --models vllm_api_stream_chat --datasets math500_gen_0_shot_cot_chat_prompt\n"
"~~~\n"
"## 5.sglang推理评测\n"
"参照 [昇腾 SGLang 最佳实践](../../model_support/examples/ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst)中评测进行"
msgstr ""
"Open another window for evaluation, and run the evaluation command:\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"    ais_bench --models vllm_api_stream_chat --datasets math500_gen_0_shot_cot_chat_prompt\n"
"~~~\n"
"## 5.sglang inference evaluation\n"
"For the evaluation procedure, refer to [Ascend SGLang Best Practices](../../model_support/examples/ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst)."
